{'symbol': 'TYL', 'date': '2023-01-31 09:17:00', 'title': "STATE OF KANSAS TO IMPROVE TRANSPARENCY WITH TYLER TECHNOLOGIES' DATA & INSIGHTS SOLUTIONS", 'text': "PLANO, TEXAS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TYLER TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: TYL) ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT WITH THE KANSAS DEPARTMENT OF REVENUE (KDOR) FOR TYLER'S ENTERPRISE DATA PLATFORM, OPEN DATA PLATFORM, AND ASSESSMENT CONNECT SOLUTIONS. CURRENTLY A STATEWIDE USER OF TYLER'S ASSESSMENT PRO SOLUTION, POWERED BY ORION, TO MANAGE ITS PROPERTY TAX ASSESSMENTS, THE NEW SOLUTIONS WILL ENABLE KDOR TO ACCESS PROPERTY DATA FOR ANALYSIS IN REAL-TIME."}